# Build toolchain for the standalone `compass` binary (scripts/package-cli.sh): the pins.
# Pinned exactly and installed wheels-only, like the rest of the release toolchain: the
# binary embeds the interpreter and every module it imports, so a drifting build
# dependency changes what ships. The dashboard itself is stdlib-only and adds nothing here.
# Bumps are deliberate edits; keep every pin at least two weeks old.
#
# Nothing installs this file. requirements-cli.txt is generated from it with every dependency
# pinned and held to its sha256 hashes, and the build installs that with `--no-deps`; its header
# says how. Regenerate it after any edit here.
pyinstaller==6.22.3
